600 R:16 1400:16@smooth 2000:12@smooth 1200:4@smooth 500:4@smooth R:12 1800:8@smooth 3000:20@smooth 1600:4@smooth 500:12@smooth
automate mid.resonance
0.6 R:48 1.8:6@smooth R:6 0.6:4@smooth

# --- the top voice: one note, gliding between chords a beat and a quarter behind; the last to arrive, the first to leave
